    {
      "phrase_id": "1001",
      "text_id": "agr_krot_actor_hasnot_met_seriy_100",
      "next": [
        "10001"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "1"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": null,
      "speaker_hint_basis": "unresolved",
      "EN": "Me and my boys found a nice little area full of artifacts but those army bastards attacked us for some reason. I don't know what the hell they wanted from us...",
      "JA_current": "俺たちはアーティファクトで一杯のイカした場所を見つけたんだが、Army のクソ野郎どもが、なぜか攻撃してきやがるんだ。あいつら俺たちに何か恨みでもあんのか…。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_agroprom:agr_krot_actor_hasnot_met_seriy_100#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "1002",
      "text_id": "agr_krot_actor_met_seriy_100",
      "next": [
        "10002"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "2"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": null,
      "speaker_hint_basis": "unresolved",
      "EN": "Seriy? Well, OK, listen. They say Strelok used to sneak around here. On top of that, his stash is somewhere around here below ground. I heard his group even had its base here. We also looked for the stash but we found jack shit. I'll give you all the info about the stash that we have, maybe you'll get lucky. Here, this should be everything!",
      "JA_current": "Seriy に？ そうか。じゃあ聞け。以前 Strelok はこの辺をうろついていたらしい。さらにこの辺りの地下に、奴が何かを隠したらしい。この辺を、奴の仲間が根城にしていたとも聞いたな。俺たちもその隠し場所を探したが、代わりに見つけたのはクソッたれだったのさ。お前さんに隠し場所について、もっと教えてやりたいところだが。これが隠し場所について知っている全てだ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_agroprom:agr_krot_actor_met_seriy_100#1"
      ]
    },
